Package: apa7
Title: Writing Documents in American Psychological Association
    Style, Seventh Edition
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    person("W. Joel", "Schneider", , "w.joel.schneider@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8393-5316"))
Description: Create tables and format statistics in the style of the
    Publication Manual of the American Psychological Association, Seventh
    Edition. Functions turn fitted models and data into APA-style tables
    (regression, mixed, multinomial, count, and generalized additive models;
    ANOVA; hypothesis tests; descriptive statistics; correlations;
    reliability; factor analysis; structural equation models; estimated
    marginal means; and meta-analyses), write their table notes, and extend
    'flextable' for tables made by hand.
